lidation** `(25[0-5]|2[0-4][0-9]|1[0-9]{2}|[1-9][0-9]|[0-9])` - matches 0-255 without leading zeros\n   - `25[0-5]` → 250-255\n   - `2[0-4][0-9]` → 200-249\n   - `1[0-9]{2}` → 100-199\n   - `[1-9][0-9]` → 10-99\n   - `[0-9]` → 0-9\n\n2. **Date validation with proper day ranges:**\n   - 31-day months (01,03,05,07,08,10,12): days 01-31\n   - 30-day months (04,06,09,11): days 01-30\n   - February (02): days 01-29\n\n3. **Word boundaries** - `(?<![a-zA-Z0-9])` and `(?![a-zA-Z0-9])` prevent matching dates/IPs that are part of larger alphanumeric strings (like \"1134-12-1234\")\n\n4. **Last date only** - The greedy `.*` after the IP matches as much as possible, then backtracks to find the rightmost valid date pattern\n\n5. **Line-level matching** - The `^` and `$` anchors with `re.MULTILINE` ensure each line is processed independently","ttft_ms":96245,"type":"result","duration_ms":103910,"uuid":"fc167902-3342-444b-849e-a37327aaa665","ttft_stream_ms":782,"time_to_request_ms":78,"queued_turn_count":0}
